| **G2** | Achieve: Collect Resources from Storage | FALLBACK(G2.1, G2.2) | Achieve | Resources are retrieved from storage | **FALLBACK** | If the current robot fails (e.g., battery <10%), the mission is reassigned to another robot. |
| **G3** | Achieve: Deliver Resources to Requesting Agent | FALLBACK(G3.1, G3.2) | Achieve | Resources are delivered to the specified location | **FALLBACK** | If the current robot fails (e.g., battery <30%), the mission is reassigned to another robot. |
