#### **Tasks Table**

| Name | Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots | Justification |
|------|------|----------|----------|------------------|---------------|
| **AT1** | Move to Storage Location | **AND** | Storage | 1 | Robot must reach the storage to retrieve resources. |
| **AT2** | Request Resources from Storage | **AND** | Storage | 1 | Send a message to the storage to specify the requested resources. |
| **AT3** | Wait for Resources to be Retrieved | **AND** | Storage | 1 | Wait until the storage retrieves the requested resources. |
| **AT4** | Return to Charging Station | **AND** | Charging Station | 1 | Robot returns to recharge if battery is critically low (10%). |
| **AT5** | Assign Mission to Another Robot | **AND** | N/A | 1 | Reassign the remaining task to another robot if the current one fails. |
| **AT6** | Deliver Resources to Specified Location | **AND** | Requesting Agent's Location | 1 | Deliver all resources to the destination. |
| **AT7** | Return to Checkpoint | **AND** | Checkpoint | 1 | Robot returns to a checkpoint if battery is low (30%) during delivery. |
| **AT8** | Alert Sector Manager | **AND** | Sector Manager | 1 | Trigger an alert if resources cannot be returned to a checkpoint. |

